WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:04,100
Wang Sheng didn't come here for your benefit at all.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,500
Just want something to eat

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,820
Feeling a little uncomfortable

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:11,270
But it's not as uncomfortable as imagined

5
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:14,830
It seems that I have slowly gotten used to staying here with Lin Dong.

6
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:24,460
It's really frustrating

7
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:28,330
Shen Wanyue

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:30,020
Change of heart so quickly

9
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:35,290
It’s not okay to be so controlled by Lin Dong all the time.

10
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:37,090
I have to find a way to feed him

11
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:38,690
Just get them all

12
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:59,730
There were less than a hundred people packed together

13
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:02,590
Almost all the others would starve to death.

14
00:01:02,590 --> 00:01:06,980
Either you will be poisoned to death by the ghost doctor's blood

15
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:08,580
The situation is critical now

16
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:10,780
I think we should unite

17
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:13,610
Yesterday we held a trade fair in the underground garage of the entire community

18
00:01:13,610 --> 00:01:15,410
But was robbed by Liang Meng

19
00:01:15,410 --> 00:01:17,810
As a result, no one dares to go to the underground garage now.

20
00:01:17,810 --> 00:01:20,270
Our life will only become more difficult

21
00:01:20,270 --> 00:01:22,520
So my suggestion is

22
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:25,980
The few of us who are still alive should form an alliance.

23
00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:28,670
Sharing resources and coexisting interests

24
00:01:28,670 --> 00:01:30,670
Let’s face this crisis together
